Uki-uki waku-waku chansu chansu

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:36.990
It's been two months! Two months!

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:39.190
The Planet Saltan drug smuggling case!

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:41.200
The multiple terrorist attacks on Sandala City!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.890
The kidnapping of Sir Draius!

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:45.190
Don't forget about the Fan du Rei.

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:47.640
Right! And the hijacking incident
onboard the Fan du Rei!

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:48.540
Are you getting my drift?

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:50.840
We've been working nonstop without a day off!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.610
Just work, work, work, work!

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:53.910
We don't even have time to go on a date!

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:55.210
Yeah, that's right.

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:58.970
They were cases that only you two could solve.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:00.750
It was the computer's decision and...

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:01.220
We know we're good.
It was the computer's decision and...

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.190
We know we're good.

00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:05.920
But that doesn't mean you can
keep working us like dogs!

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:07.680
Okay, okay.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.990
If you complete the sabotage mission
that you're currently assigned to,

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:11.580
I'll give you a week off.

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:12.520
Really?
Really?

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:13.820
I don't lie.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:14.990
In that case!

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:19.030
W-What?!

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:23.410
Yeah, vacation!
Yeah, vacation!

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:24.300
Vacation!

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:25.840
These girls are unbelievable.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.980
Date, date, date!

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.670
I'm going on dates 'til I drop!

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.100
Yay!
Yay!

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:39.420
Hah Hah Hah,
Dresses And Men
Should Always Be Brand New

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.180
Hello, Eddie.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:42.410
It's me, Kei.

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:44.820
Yeah, I have a week off!

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:48.060
Yeah, uh-huh. That's right.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:50.270
We badgered that stingy chief
of ours until he gave us time off.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.660
And with pay, too.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:55.640
So what do you say? Want to meet up tonight?

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:58.730
Huh? You're going away?

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:03.740
Really? You were just leaving? I see.

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:07.880
My, haven't found a date yet?

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.090
And it's been so long since you had time off, too!

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.220
Be quiet!

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:13.210
That's exactly why I can't get a hold of anyone!

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:16.180
It's too last minute.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:17.660
Oh, well.

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:18.850
Might as well try him.

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:23.220
He's not that good looking,
but he does have a nice car.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:27.100
Hey, long time no speak.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.070
Huh? Kei?

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:30.510
Have you been doing well, my dear boy?

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:31.910
U-Um, well...

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.010
Jeez, what's with you?

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:34.440
Stop acting so surprised!

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:37.770
Anyway, for once, I have tonight off.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:39.150
You're welcome to take me out.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:40.480
A-About that...

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:41.910
My mom... Well...

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.010
Your mom?

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.280
Please don't get upset.

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:50.320
Well, she thinks you're quite vulgar, so, um...

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.620
She told me to not go out with you anymore.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:55.550
Really, please don't get upset.

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:58.720
How could I not get upset?
You mama's boy!

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:02.130
Your mom doesn't want you
to go out with me anymore?

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.340
Then what?

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:05.570
If your mother tells you to jump
off a bridge, you'll do that too?!

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:08.570
I-I think that kind of language is
exactly what she was talking about.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:09.580
Sorry, Kei.

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:15.810
Ah, I'd better call my boyfriends, too.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:18.910
Hi!

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:20.180
Ah, Yuri?

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:22.220
Yeah, I'll be leaving in a few.

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.630
Eh? Really?

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:25.090
Where shall we go?

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:28.220
I have all the time in the world tonight.

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:30.560
I didn't think you'd be really coming.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:31.260
Huh?

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:34.470
Well, you always cancel because of your job.

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:36.560
Come on, Bob. Hurry up.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.200
The shower's ready.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.280
My, what a shame.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.640
Sounds like you got turned down.

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.450
This coming from you?

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:49.510
You were turned down twice!

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.620
Hmph! At least I wasn't dumped!

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.410
Yes, you were dumped!

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.100
"G.A. Francess"?

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:04.360
Francess?

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:05.720
Francess, huh?

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.540
"Dear Yuri and Kei,"

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:11.470
"I am having a birthday party at
my vacation home in Belenus..."

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:13.740
"...with some friends this evening."

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:16.610
"It would be a pleasure if you could
join us and arrive before 6 P.M."

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:24.820
I can't believe I'm going to a party wearing this.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:27.410
Blame yourself for sending
everything to the cleaners.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:31.490
Anyway, who is this Francess guy?

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.430
You don't remember either?

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:35.600
Oh, well. Doesn't matter.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:39.730
He's got to be a rich boy, if he's
sending out a formal invitation nowadays.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:40.500
You're right.

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:43.200
Let's see, to Belenus...

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:44.910
125 light years away, huh?

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:46.340
Two hours is more than
enough time to get there.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.910
Stopping at Planet Cauld at 95.30 degrees.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:50.430
Huh?

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:53.740
Okay, we'll be there in fifteen minutes.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:55.380
What are we going to Cauld for?

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:57.210
It's in the opposite direction of Belenus.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.310
I discovered a great boutique on Cauld.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:04.230
They have the trendiest party dresses.

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.590
We're going there to buy a dress?

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:09.530
Yup. I'm going to dress up to
the nines with the latest dress.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:12.630
After all, there's going to be
a bunch of rich boys at this party.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:28.870
Jeez...

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.210
For Pete's sake...

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:40.190
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.330
How much longer is she going to take?!

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:45.860
I can't decide.

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:51.910
What's that person's problem?

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:52.640
Who knows.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:56.540
There are a lot of weirdos these days,
so it's best to be careful.

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.770
Why you!

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:07.690
There's no doubt.

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:09.160
Call for reinforcements immediately.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:10.920
This is Block C, district 12.

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:17.230
They all look good on you, so just
buy them all and get on with it.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:24.740
What's going on?

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.910
You! The red-headed man!

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:28.900
Do not resist!

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:29.700
Huh?

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:32.570
You're already surrounded!

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:34.780
Calmly, put down your weapon!

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:38.750
The red-headed man?

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:40.310
M-Me?!

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.050
Do I look like a man to you?!

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.850
Peel your eyes and take a good look!

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:48.460
"Don't resist"?

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:49.730
"Put down my weapon"?!

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:51.300
What are you talking about?!

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.660
Why are you so agitated?

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:55.490
Hey, look. Isn't this great?

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:57.270
It's Moila!

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:58.800
Just as we suspected,
they're moving together.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:00.400
This is a big deal.

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:01.870
Pete, Moila!

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.180
This is for your own good. Do not resist!

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:06.370
Pete? Moila? Who are they?

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:09.750
If you resist, we have clearance to shoot to kill!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:11.720
Shoot to kill?!

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:13.340
What's going on?!

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:15.220
How should I know?

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:18.820
All I know is that we've been
dragged into something messy.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.360
Put down your weapons and turn
yourselves in immediately!

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:22.860
Turn ourselves in?

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:24.570
We're in hot water, that's for sure.

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:25.470
What should we do?

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:26.070
Not much we can do.

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:27.300
Let's get ourselves out of here.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:28.930
Run!

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:37.470
What are you doing, you klutz?

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:40.110
I just bought this, too!

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:41.870
Come back here!

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:51.480
This is endless.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.950
Let's get back to the Lovely Angel for now.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:00.900
You guys suck!

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:03.240
You're putting bullet holes in people's cars!

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:04.670
I'm glad they suck!

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:05.700
Lousy cops!

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:15.740
What are you kids doing here?

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:17.350
Can't you tell?

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.090
We're pretending to be the Dirty Pair!

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:20.620
We don't have time for this!

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.020
Go play somewhere else!

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:24.460
No way! We were here first!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:25.450
Yeah, that's right!

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.420
I bet they're bad guys!

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:28.430
All right!

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:29.530
Get 'em!

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:33.000
Why you little brats!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.300
Now you've done it!

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:42.830
Oh no! They've taken the children hostage!

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.770
I said, get off!

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:46.980
We're scary when we get angry, you know!

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.950
Ah, hey! Don't touch that control panel!

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:51.510
What should we do, sir?

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:52.650
This is beyond our capabilities!

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:55.750
Call the task force... No, call the army!

00:09:58.390 --> 00:09:59.560
Get back here!

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:00.760
Take that!

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:02.890
This isn't funny!

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:13.510
Yay! We did it!
Yay! We did it!

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:30.790
Pete, Moila, you're completely surrounded!

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.160
Release the children immediately!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:38.200
I'm begging you. Go away, please!

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.490
Can you hear me, Pete, Moila?

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:43.640
Release the children and we
guarantee we won't kill you.

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:46.740
We're not Pete or Moila!

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:48.570
We're the Lovely Angels!

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:51.280
If that doesn't ring a bell, the Dirty Pair should!

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.610
Well? Now you know who we are?

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:54.070
She's lying!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.990
Kei and Yuri of the Dirty Pair are
much better looking than these two!

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:58.090
You damn brat!

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.050
Ah, you're hurting me!

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:02.020
That hurts!

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:05.720
Pete, Moila! Stop what you're doing!

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:07.190
The children are innocent!

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:10.200
It hurts!

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:14.100
I'll say our identification numbers,
so do your job and check it.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:19.660
Mine is 234 Yand hers is 234K.

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:22.330
Okay, crosscheck it with
Headquarters immediately.

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:23.000
Yes, sir.

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:24.910
Damn lousy cops.

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:27.070
I bet this is going to take forever.

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:29.880
This is all your fault!

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:31.220
It was your idea to come here!

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:32.520
Oh, really?

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:36.220
It's because someone was
mistaken for a man, wasn't it?

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:36.960
What?

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:40.400
I'm sure you'll be a popular on
Belenus, too, with the young ladies.

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:42.430
How dare you! What about yourself?

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.230
Buying a bunch of dresses
that don't even suit you!

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:46.000
Why don't you do something about
your face, while you're at it?

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:46.430
What?
Why don't you do something about
your face, while you're at it?

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:46.800
What?

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:47.170
What?
You heard me!

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:47.600
You heard me!

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:50.100
Maybe they are the real Dirty Pair.

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:50.860
Yeah.

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:56.740
Hey, this isn't the time to be fighting
amongst ourselves, don't you think?

00:11:57.510 --> 00:11:58.850
I know.

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:00.780
We need to get ourselves out of here somehow.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:04.180
Are you thinking what I'm thinking?

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:07.090
Yeah, but it's a bit heavy handed.

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:08.850
So be it.

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:13.550
All right, let's get started!
All right, let's get started!

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:24.470
Let me go!

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:27.770
Come down like a good boy
and I won't punish you.

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:31.140
No way! You don't look trustworthy at all!

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:33.540
Impudent little brat!

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:34.940
All right.

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:46.760
You have nowhere to run.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:48.990
Looks like they gave you a hard time.

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:51.190
I'm so fed up with these little demons.

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:54.960
Let me go!

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:58.060
Ow!

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:00.830
Good job.

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:02.840
They gave you a hard time, too, huh?

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:04.430
There, there.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:05.950
Let's hurry. We don't have much time left.

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:06.610
Got it!

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:12.710
Thank you all for coming, but we're
in a hurry, so we'll be off now!

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:17.290
Try anything and these kids are dead meat.

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:19.820
Damn it! Cowardly bastards!

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:29.200
There we go...

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:31.500
Behave and stay calm, okay?

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:34.670
You'll be back with your
mommies and daddies in a bit.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.710
Untie us, you ugly broad!

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:37.410
Short-legged loser!

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:37.650
Troll!
Short-legged loser!

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:38.580
Troll!

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:41.580
Jeez, you kids are really annoying!

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:43.880
Are you sure you're not related to Kei?

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:44.980
Say something?

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:47.480
Nothing. Ready on my end.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:49.720
Here we go! Hold on!

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:57.790
Bye-bye!

00:13:58.130 --> 00:13:59.330
And good riddance.

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:01.030
Yuri, we're warping in ten seconds.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:01.960
Okay.

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:19.120
Awesome! That planet is
ten light years away now!

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.220
That was a quick warp.

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:22.220
Okay, let's head straight to Belenus.

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:23.790
Party, party.

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:25.760
Lots of handsome guys.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.230
Lots of yummy food.

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:32.120
Hurray, hurray, hurray, hurray, hurray!
Hurray, hurray, hurray, hurray, hurray!

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:33.370
Hurray!

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.400
Hey, we're going to warp again, right?

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:38.470
Ugh...
Ugh...

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:46.880
Sorry, but it's only until we finish
checking your identification numbers,

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.180
so just hang tight.

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:51.220
You're going to regret it,
once you see who we are!

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:52.650
Sorry, it's the rules.

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:53.550
Do you know who you're messing wi-

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:57.990
Oh, right.

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:01.030
These bars have electricity running
through them, so please don't touch them.

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:02.260
