to release the hostages.

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:44.770
Look, it's the Dirty Pair!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.700
It's the Dirty Pair!
It's the Dirty Pair!

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:49.770
