00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.430
What a surprise!

00:16:57.550 --> 00:17:02.070
The beautiful and invincible duo,
Kei and Yuri, are here on Cauld!

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:05.750
W-We were just swinging by for some shopping.

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:06.910
It's too late!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:10.360
Oh, boy, am I glad to see you two here.

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:13.790
Truth is, we've never had to deal with
anything of this magnitude before.

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:15.390
Okay, okay.

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:17.660
Might as well see things through, I guess.

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:22.040
Hurry up and get us a spaceship!

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:23.230
You have thirty minutes!

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.500
Out of the way!
Out of the way!

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:26.900
You understand? Thirty minutes!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.000
That's thirty minutes too late!

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:32.310
We're in a super rush!

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:39.250
Pete!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:41.850
