00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:22.400
What the?!

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:24.020
They're so old!

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:26.030
Hey, how are they supposed to look like us?

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:26.930
You got to be kidding me!

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:28.770
I second that!

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:32.510
But she looks just like you, when you
don't have all that make up on.

00:18:32.510 --> 00:18:33.270
What?!

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:35.240
At least I have room for improvement!

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:37.350
I don't need to improve anything
because I'm already beautiful.

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:37.780
That's what all the romantically challenged...
I don't need to improve anything
because I'm already beautiful.

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:37.850
That's what all the romantically challenged...

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:38.780
That's what all the romantically challenged...
