00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:04.400
Perverts!

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:12.170
Standby for launch!

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:12.940
All right!

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:16.580
Here we go!

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:20.620
Do we have time?

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:21.650
Yup, we can still make it!

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:23.920
Not a minute too soon to put
